a, pausa de 1s","desc":"Resistencia intermedia, contracción marcada."},{"name":"Banda fuerte, tempo lento","desc":"Resistencia elevada, movimiento ralentizado."}]},"meta":{"minLevel":0,"difficulty":1,"mastery":"faible","duration":5,"period":"toute-saison","publics":["mixte"],"ageGroups":["moins18","jeuneAdulte","plus30","plus50"],"equipment":["élastique"],"disciplines":["polyvalent"],"energy":["prevention"],"pose":{"pose":"standing","equip":"none","variants":null,"weight":[false,false,false]}}}'::jsonb),
